[en.IDEA_C15_SOMBRA_FAITH_MANDATE]
Sombra’s Mandate

[en.IDEA_C15_SOMBRA_FAITH_MANDATE_desc]
The Mandate of Sombra replaced the Crystal Sacrament as the state religion of the new Empire. Rejoice, for the King of Monsters!

[zh.IDEA_C15_SOMBRA_FAITH_MANDATE]
森布拉的旨意

[zh.IDEA_C15_SOMBRA_FAITH_MANDATE_desc]
森布拉大王的旨意取代了《水晶圣章》，成为新帝国的国教。欢呼吧，为了怪物之王！
